tory generation for a child.\npackages/api/src/routers/README.md:45:Poll story generation progress (every 2 seconds).\npackages/api/src/routers/README.md:218:- **Cost Tracking:** Each story generation costs ~$0.235 (text + 6 images).\ndocs/CREDIT_SYSTEM_ANALYSIS.md:225:The story generation flow checks credits client-side but doesn't show the actual deduction logic. Need to verify:\ndocs/CREDIT_SYSTEM_ANALYSIS.md:226:- Is credit deducted BEFORE or AFTER story generation?\ndocs/CREDIT_SYSTEM_ANALYSIS.md:230:**Status**: ⚠️ NEEDS VERIFICATION - Cannot see server-side story generation code.\ndocs/CREDIT_SYSTEM_ANALYSIS.md:440:4. Block story generation\ndocs/CREDIT_SYSTEM_ANALYSIS.md:833:- [ ] Test story generation with sufficient credits\ndocs/solutioning-gate-check-codex-v2.md:6:- Compliance, performance, and personalization levers (photo deletion, <30s story generation, multi-art-style avatars) are consistently stated across documents (docs/PRD.md:21-24,64-69,120-125; docs/architecture.md:24-55,170,219-239; docs/epics.md:493-715,672-697,835-1113).\ndocs/solutioning-gate-check-codex-v2.md:12:- **Non-functional guarantees:** PRD success metrics call for <30s story generation, photo deletion within 24-48h, and offline reading; the architecture outlines matching performance strategies, deletion audit trails, and offline caching patterns (docs/PRD.md:64-69,120-125,332-335; docs/architecture.md:24-55,26,219-239,430).\ndocs/solutioning-gate-check-gemini.md:33:- **Performance:** The goal of sub-30-second story generation is addressed through proposed parallel API calls and a CDN-first approach for assets.\ndocs/MOBILE_AGENT_FOLLOWUP.md:103:### 3. `app/(tabs)/index.tsx` or story generation screen\ndocs/MOBILE_AGENT_FOLLOWUP.md:104:**Add cost display before story generation:**\ndocs/epic-tech-specs/epic-4-tech-spec.md:189:**Description:** Orchestrate complete story generation (text + images)\ndocs/epic-tech-specs/epic-4-tech-spec.md:217:4. Create story generation job record\ndoc