{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_79","type":"reasoning","text":"**Identifying invalid import and env mismatch**\n\nThe PDF route incorrectly imports `db` instead of the exported `prisma`, causing a runtime crash; also, the Supabase env key uses `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` earlier but `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY` elsewhere, indicating an environment mismatch. Next, I'll check the payment verification logic for Stripe in the credits router."}}
