d;\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_97","type":"reasoning","text":"**Analyzing incomplete payment verification**\n\nPayment verification is incomplete, especially for Apple/Google purchases, lacking full server-side checks like bundle ID and expiry for Apple, and missing acknowledgement/consumption calls for Google, risking purchase reuse. The `purchaseCredits` procedure increments credits without verifying payments, which could be exploited if used from the client or UI; I'll review the web purchase page to understand Stripe checkout and overall verification flow."}}
